WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.900
The crank turns, and the rod pushes the slider along its track.

2
00:00:04.926 --> 00:00:08.051
The pin is twenty-five millimetres from the centre.

3
00:00:12.733 --> 00:00:15.433
One turn makes one stroke out and back.

4
00:00:16.361 --> 00:00:19.811
So the stroke is twice the radius: fifty millimetres.
